# A question from the agent offers its choices; choosing one answers it.
# The fixture fails the turn unless the answer is exactly the "続ける" choice.
# iOS: testSimulatorSendsQuestionChoiceOnTap
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press このプロジェクトで新しいチャット
type "AI に依頼する" "[request] [choice] 質問に答えます"
press 送信
expect "このまま続けますか？" 20000
expect "見直す"
screenshot asked
press 続ける
expect_absent "このまま続けますか？" 20000
expect "シミュレータで完了しました。" 30000
screenshot answered
